{
  "language": "zh",
  "duration": 353.7574375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.72,
      "end": 6.1,
      "text": "哈喽朋友们 欢迎收看三十次游动机一天吃什么了"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 6.1,
      "end": 8.86,
      "text": "早上第一顿必须是书果陆"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 8.86,
      "end": 12.14,
      "text": "我在东千喝的书果陆和夏天会有点吃别"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 12.14,
      "end": 14.68,
      "text": "在东千我会用温水去打"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 14.68,
      "end": 18.04,
      "text": "然后里面会多放一些江黄肉贵铃铃铃"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 18.04,
      "end": 19.46,
      "text": "就是这种非常暖的粉丝"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 19.46,
      "end": 20.78,
      "text": "就不会很含量"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 20.78,
      "end": 24.18,
      "text": "这一杯的精水就在于我在里面放了一些夏微果"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 24.18,
      "end": 26.42,
      "text": "所以它喝起来会有一些奶味哦"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 26.42,
      "end": 28.42,
      "text": "很好和大肯试试"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 28.42,
      "end": 30.18,
      "text": "而且它虽然是温味的"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 30.18,
      "end": 33.02,
      "text": "但口感很好不会让大家认为这些"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 33.02,
      "end": 34.42,
      "text": "这个喝点是温味的"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 34.42,
      "end": 36.66,
      "text": "一般这一杯喝完我就要去测索了"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 36.66,
      "end": 38.58,
      "text": "非常非常通常的"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 38.58,
      "end": 41.22,
      "text": "那现在刚在我们熬里的早餐啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 41.22,
      "end": 43.26,
      "text": "那你还没吃早餐呢是不是"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 43.26,
      "end": 44.54,
      "text": "然后过来过来过来"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 44.54,
      "end": 45.54,
      "text": "这个小朋友"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 45.54,
      "end": 48.26,
      "text": "逃级点力又很挑食"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 48.26,
      "end": 50.06,
      "text": "什么十两都不吃"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 50.06,
      "end": 53.78,
      "text": "所以我一般早晚都会给它吃这种泡水洞干"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 53.78,
      "end": 55.74,
      "text": "你是想吃这个"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 55.74,
      "end": 56.94,
      "text": "脱肉等呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 56.94,
      "end": 59.22,
      "text": "还是要吃这个生股肉"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 59.22,
      "end": 59.98,
      "text": "于想要的呀"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 59.98,
      "end": 62.54,
      "text": "脱肉脱肉"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 62.54,
      "end": 65.26,
      "text": "真棒 好脱肉"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 65.26,
      "end": 66.02,
      "text": "五个"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 66.02,
      "end": 68.7,
      "text": "它只会把这个水都吃了完了之后"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 68.7,
      "end": 70.54,
      "text": "才能把这个洞干给吃进去"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 70.54,
      "end": 73.14,
      "text": "它我会直接从水里面把洞干掉出来"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 73.14,
      "end": 74.5,
      "text": "不问了屁然它多喝点水"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 74.5,
      "end": 75.7,
      "text": "里面就小猫咪"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 75.7,
      "end": 77.7,
      "text": "它很容易变密"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 77.7,
      "end": 79.02,
      "text": "光盼了"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 79.02,
      "end": 80.42,
      "text": "昨天晚上会太晚了"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 80.42,
      "end": 81.3,
      "text": "没有洗头"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 81.3,
      "end": 82.1,
      "text": "现在洗头"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 83.1,
      "end": 85.14,
      "text": "我中午点的椰子机外卖"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 85.14,
      "end": 87.54,
      "text": "我发现椰子机除了好多新款"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 87.54,
      "end": 89.22,
      "text": "以前吃只有什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 89.22,
      "end": 90.34,
      "text": "煮鲜椰子机"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 90.34,
      "end": 92.82,
      "text": "现在什么流连的秋梨蛋"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 92.82,
      "end": 94.82,
      "text": "我点的是鲜果椰子机"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 94.82,
      "end": 96.1,
      "text": "里面有无花果"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 96.1,
      "end": 97.02,
      "text": "木瓜"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 97.02,
      "end": 99.3,
      "text": "人生果玉米铃子什么的"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 99.3,
      "end": 101.7,
      "text": "很好吃很清爽"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 101.7,
      "end": 102.7,
      "text": "我已经爱上了"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 102.7,
      "end": 104.22,
      "text": "我最近调好几次"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 104.22,
      "end": 106.9,
      "text": "椰子机和水果的搭配很奇妙"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 106.9,
      "end": 107.86,
      "text": "广东人吃"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 107.86,
      "end": 109.46,
      "text": "今天真的是有一套"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 109.46,
      "end": 111.5,
      "text": "每一次吃这个椰子机里面的"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 111.5,
      "end": 112.26,
      "text": "饭"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 112.26,
      "end": 113.06,
      "text": "我都要饭"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 113.06,
      "end": 114.18,
      "text": "这个料"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 114.18,
      "end": 115.38,
      "text": "网里面的椰子"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 115.38,
      "end": 116.94,
      "text": "胡椒人就太胜痛"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 116.94,
      "end": 117.98,
      "text": "不价这个价格的话"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 117.98,
      "end": 119.0,
      "text": "它都会很淡"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 119.0,
      "end": 120.46,
      "text": "很香"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 120.46,
      "end": 121.22,
      "text": "很香"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 121.22,
      "end": 122.34,
      "text": "一般吃完午饭"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 122.34,
      "end": 124.14,
      "text": "我就会开始吃我的内部了"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 124.14,
      "end": 126.22,
      "text": "还是第三家鱼肉加胡鱼"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 126.22,
      "end": 127.98,
      "text": "每天来一大目东"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 127.98,
      "end": 130.06,
      "text": "儿ly 周五吃什么"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 130.06,
      "end": 131.58,
      "text": "她的鱼有"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 131.82,
      "end": 137.54,
      "text": "你就好"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 137.54,
      "end": 141.26,
      "text": "看来今天真的是很像是"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 143.26,
      "end": 144.94,
      "text": "每次就是把这个鱼有几道"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 144.94,
      "end": 146.94,
      "text": "就动干一上涨再让它吃下去"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 146.94,
      "end": 148.94,
      "text": "不然单独的鱼油它不会吃"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 148.94,
      "end": 151.44,
      "text": "它自从吃的鱼油之后三个月了"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 151.44,
      "end": 152.94,
      "text": "它现在真的不怎么叫毛了"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 152.94,
      "end": 156.83,
      "text": "我一打开门"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 156.83,
      "end": 159.03,
      "text": "加门口对了好多快递养"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 159.03,
      "end": 160.53,
      "text": "有了快递着咱起来"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 160.53,
      "end": 162.03,
      "text": "到时候给大家拍开箱"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 162.03,
      "end": 163.63,
      "text": "但是像小零食这种"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 163.63,
      "end": 166.03,
      "text": "我是真的赞不了一点的"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 166.03,
      "end": 167.23,
      "text": "准备"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 167.23,
      "end": 169.03,
      "text": "拆平锅手机了"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 169.03,
      "end": 170.53,
      "text": "我想要拍拿着产品"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 170.53,
      "end": 173.53,
      "text": "然后能看见我的那个双镜头的那个"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 173.53,
      "end": 175.53,
      "text": "视频可以买了这个"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 176.53,
      "end": 178.53,
      "text": "直接打开之后就"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 178.53,
      "end": 180.53,
      "text": "套上咱们的"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 181.53,
      "end": 182.53,
      "text": "手机可来的"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 182.53,
      "end": 184.53,
      "text": "早上的那个早餐"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 184.53,
      "end": 186.53,
      "text": "这个红薰火都给我弄了半个"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 186.53,
      "end": 188.53,
      "text": "然后还有半个红薰的吃了"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 191.53,
      "end": 194.53,
      "text": "这个材物株干我是看愿然的视频推荐的"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 194.53,
      "end": 196.53,
      "text": "真的还蛮好吃的很购味"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 196.53,
      "end": 198.53,
      "text": "而且它居然是我老家生产的"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 198.53,
      "end": 200.53,
      "text": "两段那么购味"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 200.53,
      "end": 202.53,
      "text": "晚上会朋友約了吃饭"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 203.53,
      "end": 206.53,
      "text": "我发现我不是和那种很明昐的原则"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 206.53,
      "end": 208.53,
      "text": "这种第一宝和的豆沙呀"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 208.53,
      "end": 210.53,
      "text": "煙粉熟悉饭而比较适合我"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 210.53,
      "end": 213.53,
      "text": "O.T.D整式准备出门楼"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 213.53,
      "end": 215.53,
      "text": "现在先去接我朋友"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 215.53,
      "end": 216.53,
      "text": "出饭"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 216.53,
      "end": 218.53,
      "text": "我们晚上要去舍口吃一家"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 218.53,
      "end": 221.53,
      "text": "超火的同锅善仰肉"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 221.53,
      "end": 223.53,
      "text": "我来了一锅呀"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 223.53,
      "end": 224.53,
      "text": "没事"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 224.53,
      "end": 226.53,
      "text": "它排队我们五点多钟就到了"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 226.53,
      "end": 228.53,
      "text": "我的战略就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 228.53,
      "end": 230.53,
      "text": "什么都放一点"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": 230.53,
      "end": 232.53,
      "text": "让我这个虎耐人平时吃火锅的话"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": 232.53,
      "end": 235.53,
      "text": "我是完全受不了放麻酱和服务的"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 235.53,
      "end": 236.53,
      "text": "但是吃羊肉的话"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 236.53,
      "end": 239.53,
      "text": "我一定会加和羊肉真的是橘配"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 239.53,
      "end": 242.53,
      "text": "其实有东西是要少吃羊肉的"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 242.53,
      "end": 243.53,
      "text": "但我都要先吃羊肉的"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 243.53,
      "end": 245.53,
      "text": "所以偶尔罪餐"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": 245.53,
      "end": 247.53,
      "text": "想吃也不会那么容易长度"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": 247.53,
      "end": 249.53,
      "text": "他们家的羊肉真的蛮好吃的"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": 249.53,
      "end": 251.53,
      "text": "就很新鲜"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 251.53,
      "end": 252.53,
      "text": "很够味"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 252.53,
      "end": 254.53,
      "text": "尤其是这个牛肉烧味"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 254.53,
      "end": 256.53,
      "text": "哇 刚刚真出来"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 256.53,
      "end": 258.53,
      "text": "真的好觉"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 259.53,
      "end": 260.53,
      "text": "肉烧卖"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": 260.53,
      "end": 262.53,
      "text": "哇 好好吃"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": 262.53,
      "end": 264.53,
      "text": "没让你吃"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": 264.53,
      "end": 265.53,
      "text": "而且新鲜比真的很高"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "start": 265.53,
      "end": 267.53,
      "text": "我们两个人吃群厚的话"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "start": 267.53,
      "end": 269.53,
      "text": "才吃了200块钱不到"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "start": 269.53,
      "end": 271.53,
      "text": "时刻这边真的是有很多很多"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "start": 271.53,
      "end": 272.53,
      "text": "好吃的"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "start": 272.53,
      "end": 274.53,
      "text": "可以说是我的美食物脱帮"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "start": 274.53,
      "end": 276.53,
      "text": "我差不多每周都会来一趟时刻"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "start": 276.53,
      "end": 277.53,
      "text": "来吃美食"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "start": 277.53,
      "end": 278.53,
      "text": "吃完了火锅"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "start": 278.53,
      "end": 280.53,
      "text": "现在去吃一个棉莓"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "start": 280.53,
      "end": 282.53,
      "text": "你羊肉店大概走路"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "start": 282.53,
      "end": 284.53,
      "text": "也就五分钟不到吧"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "start": 284.53,
      "end": 286.53,
      "text": "他们家的棉莓"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "start": 286.53,
      "end": 287.53,
      "text": "用的是水牛奶"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "start": 287.53,
      "end": 288.53,
      "text": "就能吃出来"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "start": 288.53,
      "end": 289.53,
      "text": "不是那种加了奶"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "start": 289.53,
      "end": 290.53,
      "text": "已经的味道"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "start": 290.53,
      "end": 291.53,
      "text": "而且它家的棉莓"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "start": 291.53,
      "end": 292.53,
      "text": "没有那么容易换"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "start": 292.53,
      "end": 293.53,
      "text": "很杀识"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "start": 293.53,
      "end": 295.53,
      "text": "玉尼蒂蒂的"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "start": 295.53,
      "end": 297.53,
      "text": "我这次点的是新品草"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "start": 297.53,
      "end": 298.53,
      "text": "没味的"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "start": 298.53,
      "end": 299.53,
      "text": "我觉得还是没有他们家"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "start": 299.53,
      "end": 300.53,
      "text": "招牌忙活的好吃"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "start": 300.53,
      "end": 301.53,
      "text": "我就发现"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "start": 301.53,
      "end": 302.53,
      "text": "如果以后是"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "start": 302.53,
      "end": 303.53,
      "text": "带朋友去品上"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "start": 303.53,
      "end": 304.53,
      "text": "不仅喜欢的"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "start": 304.53,
      "end": 305.53,
      "text": "美食的时候"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "start": 305.53,
      "end": 306.53,
      "text": "还是不要点自己"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "start": 306.53,
      "end": 308.53,
      "text": "都没吃过的"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "start": 308.53,
      "end": 309.53,
      "text": "经验之态"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "start": 309.53,
      "end": 310.53,
      "text": "吃完棉莓"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "start": 310.53,
      "end": 311.53,
      "text": "才8点多钟"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "start": 311.53,
      "end": 312.53,
      "text": "我们就准备"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "start": 312.53,
      "end": 313.53,
      "text": "去深圳外喝点小酒"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "start": 313.53,
      "end": 315.53,
      "text": "去开车的时候发现"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "start": 315.53,
      "end": 316.53,
      "text": "妈呀"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "start": 316.53,
      "end": 318.53,
      "text": "我新喜的车上有"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "start": 318.53,
      "end": 319.53,
      "text": "好多厚多的"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "start": 319.53,
      "end": 321.53,
      "text": "小猫咪的小脚银"
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "start": 321.53,
      "end": 323.53,
      "text": "不知道是哪一只小猫咪"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "start": 323.53,
      "end": 324.53,
      "text": "这么有眼光"
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "start": 324.53,
      "end": 325.53,
      "text": "我看这一排"
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "start": 325.53,
      "end": 326.53,
      "text": "只有我的车上有"
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "start": 326.53,
      "end": 328.53,
      "text": "我2020年的心爱"
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "start": 328.53,
      "end": 329.53,
      "text": "好就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "start": 329.53,
      "end": 330.53,
      "text": "喝点小酒"
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "start": 330.53,
      "end": 331.53,
      "text": "是不是跟朋友"
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "start": 331.53,
      "end": 332.53,
      "text": "小卓一杯"
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "start": 332.53,
      "end": 333.53,
      "text": "它一开心了"
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "start": 333.53,
      "end": 335.53,
      "text": "是我皮肥生活中的调味级"
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "start": 335.53,
      "end": 337.53,
      "text": "清好皮不才会好"
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "start": 337.53,
      "end": 338.53,
      "text": "回家了"
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "start": 338.53,
      "end": 339.53,
      "text": "第一时间"
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "start": 339.53,
      "end": 341.53,
      "text": "先喝个小猫"
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "start": 341.53,
      "end": 343.81,
      "text": "好吗"
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "start": 343.81,
      "end": 344.81,
      "text": "然后呢"
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "start": 344.81,
      "end": 345.81,
      "text": "喝点小猫"
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "start": 345.81,
      "end": 346.81,
      "text": "小铃银时"
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "start": 346.81,
      "end": 347.81,
      "text": "中了一会儿"
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "start": 347.81,
      "end": 348.81,
      "text": "大细了的睡觉了"
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "start": 348.81,
      "end": 349.81,
      "text": "视频"
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "start": 349.81,
      "end": 350.81,
      "text": "就到这里了"
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "start": 350.81,
      "end": 351.81,
      "text": "第一次排我老个希望"
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "start": 351.81,
      "end": 352.81,
      "text": "大家会喜欢"
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "start": 352.81,
      "end": 353.81,
      "text": "拜拜"
    }
  ]
}